            "review_text": "Paul Christian C\nManila, Philippines210 contributions\n0\nA local beer garden with tasty food\nJan 2015 • Family\nIt is near our hotel and was almost always jampacked. It seemed that this was a regular stop of employees from their work. We had a hard time here because no one understands english. Somehow annoyed by waitresses offering beer every minute or so (understandable, as it was a beer garden). The food was good and not that expensive.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 17, 2015",
