            "review_text": "Patrik V\nKeerbergen, Belgium6 contributions\n0\nExcellent food in local setting\nApr 2014 • Couples\nLike to share our excellent dining experience in this restaurant. We came here by coincidence while strolling in the streets looking for dining.\nThe setting is very local, large terras. Think we were the only tourists here. \nOur 2 ordered dishes were.delicious. \nI had taken hot pot with shrimps. Really good and enough for 4 people... My wife had stir fried noodles with seafood. Hmmm. \nRecommend if you like good food and local atmosphere.\nRead more\nWritten April 3, 2014",
